  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nXPointer ranges fail to copy namespace nodes, resulting in use-after-free errors.  \n  \n**VERSION**   \nChrome Version: 51.0.2704.106 stable  \nOperating System: Windows 10, 64-bit  \n  \n**REPRODUCTION CASE**   \nSee the attached files xpointer-ns-uaf.xml and xpointer-ns-uaf."
